{"3389390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Speed Rivals - Slot Racing", "steam_appid": 3389390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1786792526\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1786792526\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock over <strong>  cars</strong> — from timeless classics to futuristic beasts. Repaint, add decals, slap on logos — make it yours. More cars and updates will keep coming based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.poster.avif?t=1786792526\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.webm?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.mp4?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on every track. Master the rail, design impossible challenges, battle in tournaments, and take on your friends. With constant updates and an active community, <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is waiting for you. Ready to hit the track?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/9221c2649572d7f15b61f8316433cb2c.avif?t=1786792526\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1786792526\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1786792526\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock over <strong>  cars</strong> — from timeless classics to futuristic beasts. Repaint, add decals, slap on logos — make it yours. More cars and updates will keep coming based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.poster.avif?t=1786792526\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.webm?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.mp4?t=1786792526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on every track. Master the rail, design impossible challenges, battle in tournaments, and take on your friends. With constant updates and an active community, <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is waiting for you. Ready to hit the track?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_